  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child project of the Global clean hydrogen program of South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present Child Project of South Africa is part of the Global Clean Hydrogen Programme (GEF-8). This project aims to enhancing national institutional capacities, enabling policy frameworks, improving technological readiness at industrial level, and financial mechanisms for the successful uptake of clean hydrogen in South Africa, to ensure its net zero development with social considerations and benefits.</narrative>
  </description>
